# Changelog

User-facing release notes live in [`CHANGELOG.md`](../../CHANGELOG.md). Policy: [`docs/change-management.md`](../../docs/change-management.md).

## On user-visible change sets

1. Add a bullet under **`## [Unreleased]`** in the same commit/PR as the code.
2. Follow skill [`.cursor/skills/peaky-changelog/SKILL.md`](../skills/peaky-changelog/SKILL.md).
3. Group related work into one bullet; do not mirror every commit.

## Commits vs changelog

| Commits | Changelog |
|---------|-----------|
| Conventional, granular, for bisect | Curated, grouped, for users |
| Required format | Required on user-facing ships |

Commit subjects do **not** feed GitHub Releases anymore.

## Release cut

Promote Unreleased → `## [vX.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD`, run `./scripts/changelog.sh check`, then tag. Skill: **`peaky-release`**.
